,"NET","PANW","RDWR","ZS"],"beta":0.62,"beta_5y":0.62,"kd":4.5,"tax":21,"growth_10y":[5.4,4.9,4.4,4,3.8,3.5,3.2,2.9,2.6,2.2],"g1":5.4,"g2":3.5,"g":2.25,"wacc":5.85,"ev":19425.5,"fmp_official_ev":19425.5,"dcf_model_ev":20335.7,"ev_to_ebitda":15.1,"debt_to_ebitda":7.26,"net_debt_to_ebitda":4.65,"f_score":5,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 2.7%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $630M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 68.5%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.64"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":99.86,"default_fair_val":99.86,"premium_pct":-6.3,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":32.7,"pe_forward":28.8,"pb_trailing":2.8,"pb_forward":2.5,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":5.3,"fcf_to_ev":3.24,"fcf_to_mcap":4.69,"liab_to_assets":68.5,"cash_to_assets":22.3,"current_ratio":1.64,"roe":8.7,"roa":2.7,"moat":{"ticker":"AKAM","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Akamai 在內容傳遞網路 (CDN) 領域擁有強大的品牌聲譽，這使其在定價上具有一定的優勢。客戶高度依賴其服務的穩定性與效能，因此品牌信任度成為重要的定價依據。然而，CDN 市場競爭激烈，新興技術和競爭者不斷湧現，對其長期定價權構成挑戰。雖然 Akamai 的品牌能支撐其溢價，但面對價格敏感的客戶群和不斷變化的市場格局，其定價權並非絕對，屬於堅固但非無敵的壁壘。","comment_en":"Akamai possesses a strong brand reputation in the Content Delivery Network (CDN) space, granting it a degree of pricing power. Customers rely heavily on the stability and performance of its services, making brand trust a significant factor in its pricing. However, the CDN market is intensely competitive, with emerging technologies and new entrants constantly challenging its long-term pricing power. While Akamai's brand can support premium pricing, the price-sensitive nature of some customer segments and the evolving market landscape mean its pricing power is not absolute, representing a solid but not invincible barrier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"Akamai 的核心技術，特別是在網路傳輸優化和安全方面，可能受到專利的保護。然而，軟體和網路服務領域的專利壁壘相對較弱，技術迭代速度快，專利保護的時效性有限。此外，該行業的監管環境相對寬鬆，較少有顯著的特許經營權或政府許可證構成強大壁壘。因此，專利和監管在 Akamai 的護城河中扮演的角色較為次要，提供的保護是中等且易受挑戰的。","comment_en":"Akamai's core technologies, particularly in network transmission optimization and security, may be protected by patents. However, patent barriers in the software and network services sector are relatively weaker, with rapid technological iteration limiting the longevity of patent protection. Furthermore, the regulatory environment in this industry is generally permissive, with few significant franchises or government licenses acting as strong barriers. Consequently, patents and regulation play a secondary role in Akamai's moat, offering moderate and potentially challengeable protection."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Akamai 的服務深度整合到客戶的線上業務運營中，涉及內容分發、網站加速和安全防護。一旦客戶將其基礎設施遷移至 Akamai，重新配置和測試替代方案將耗費大量時間、資源和潛在的業務中斷風險。這種技術整合的深度和對業務連續性的依賴，構成了顯著的轉換成本壁壘。客戶雖然可能尋求更具成本效益的方案，但實際轉換的門檻較高，使得 Akamai 能夠維持較高的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"Akamai's services are deeply integrated into the online operational infrastructure of its clients, encompassing content delivery, website acceleration, and security. Migrating away from Akamai involves significant time, resources, and potential business disruption risks associated with reconfiguring and testing alternative solutions. This depth of technical integration and reliance on business continuity creates a substantial switching cost barrier. While clients may explore more cost-effective options, the practical threshold for switching is high, enabling Akamai to maintain strong customer stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Akamai 的網絡效應體現在其龐大的全球分佈式基礎設施。更多的客戶使用其服務，意味著更多的數據點用於優化網絡性能和安全威脅的識別，這反過來又提升了服務對所有用戶的價值。同時，其龐大的用戶基礎也吸引了更多的內容提供商和應用開發者在其平台上部署，形成正向循環。雖然這種網絡效應不如社交平台那樣直接，但對於 CDN 服務的效率和安全性而言，其影響是顯著的，提供了中等到較強的壁壘。","comment_en":"Akamai's network effects are evident in its vast, globally distributed infrastructure. More customers using its services translate into more data points for optimizing network performance and identifying security threats, which in turn enhances the service's value for all users. Concurrently, its large user base attracts more content providers and application developers to deploy on its platform, creating a virtuous cycle. While this network effect is less direct than in social platforms, its impact on CDN service efficiency and security is significant, providing a moderate to strong barrier."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Akamai 作為全球最大的 CDN 服務提供商之一，其龐大的基礎設施規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。透過規模化運營，Akamai 能夠在採購帶寬、伺服器維護和數據中心租賃等方面獲得更優惠的價格。這種規模經濟效應使得新進入者難以在成本上與之競爭。此外，其龐大的流量處理能力也使其能夠更有效地分攤固定成本，進一步鞏固了其在成本結構上的領先地位，構成了一個堅實的壁壘。","comment_en":"As one of the world's largest CDN providers, Akamai's massive infrastructure scale confers significant cost advantages. Through scaled operations, Akamai can secure more favorable pricing for bandwidth procurement, server maintenance, and data center leases. This economy of scale makes it difficult for new entrants to compete on cost. Furthermore, its substantial traffic handling capacity allows for more effective absorption of fixed costs, further solidifying its leading position in cost structure and establishing a robust barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Akamai 擁有遍佈全球的龐大伺服器網絡，這使其能夠在接近用戶端的位置提供低延遲的內容傳輸和安全服務。這種地理上的廣泛佈局是其核心競爭力之一，尤其是在需要快速響應的應用場景下。然而，隨著雲端基礎設施的普及和競爭對手的擴張，其他大型雲服務商（如 AWS, Azure, Google Cloud）也在建立自己的全球網絡，使得 Akamai 的地理優勢相對減弱，但仍構成一定的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"Akamai operates a vast global network of servers, enabling it to deliver low-latency content delivery and security services close to end-users. This extensive geographical footprint is a key competitive strength, especially for applications requiring rapid response times. However, with the proliferation of cloud infrastructure and the expansion of competitors, other major cloud providers (like AWS, Azure, Google Cloud) are also building their own global networks, somewhat diminishing Akamai's unique geographical advantage. Nevertheless, it still constitutes a certain competitive barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Akamai 在營運效率方面表現出色，其核心業務是高效地管理和調度全球龐大的網絡資源，以確保內容的快速、可靠傳輸和安全防護。長期的營運經驗和持續的技術投入，使其在網絡優化、流量管理和故障排除方面建立了深厚的專業知識。這種卓越的營運能力不僅降低了成本，也提升了服務品質，是其維持市場領導地位的重要因素，構成了堅實的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"Akamai demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, with its core business focused on effectively managing and orchestrating vast global network resources to ensure fast, reliable content delivery and security. Long-term operational experience and continuous technological investment have fostered deep expertise in network optimization, traffic management, and troubleshooting. This superior operational capability not only reduces costs but also enhances service quality, serving as a crucial factor in maintaining its market leadership and forming a solid competitive barrier."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Akamai 的資本配置策略似乎側重於基礎設施的擴張和技術研發，以維持其在 CDN 和邊緣計算領域的競爭力。公司透過自由現金流進行再投資，並適時進行戰略性收購以擴展服務組合。雖然其資本配置方向合理，但相較於某些擁有更廣泛業務範疇或更高資本回報率的企業，其資本配置的獨特優勢並不明顯。整體而言，其資本配置能力屬於中等偏上，能夠支持其業務發展，但未構成極強的壁壘。","comment_en":"Akamai's capital allocation strategy appears focused on infrastructure expansion and technological R&D to maintain its competitiveness in CDN and edge computing. The company reinvests its free cash flow and makes strategic acquisitions opportunistically to broaden its service portfolio. While its capital allocation direction is sound, its unique advantages in capital allocation are not as pronounced compared to some companies with broader business scopes or higher capital return rates. Overall, its capital allocation capability is above average, supporting business development but not forming an exceptionally strong barrier."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，Akamai 的服務深度整合以及客戶對其穩定性和性能的高度依賴，共同造就了較高的客戶留存率。一旦客戶習慣了 Akamai 的解決方案並將其納入關鍵業務流程，轉換的成本和風險會顯著提高。此外，Akamai 持續推出新服務和功能，以滿足不斷變化的客戶需求，進一步增強了客戶黏性。這種基於服務深度整合和持續價值提供的客戶留存，構成了堅固的壁壘。","comment_en":"As described in M3, Akamai's deep service integration and customers' high reliance on its stability and performance contribute to a relatively high customer retention rate. Once clients become accustomed to Akamai's solutions and incorporate them into critical business processes, the cost and risk of switching increase significantly. Furthermore, Akamai continuously introduces new services and features to meet evolving customer needs, further enhancing customer loyalty. This customer retention, based on deep service integration and continuous value delivery, forms a solid barrier."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Akamai 的業務模式在可預見的未來具有相當的持久性。隨著互聯網流量的持續增長、對線上安全需求的提升以及邊緣計算的興起，Akamai 的核心服務依然至關重要。儘管面臨來自雲端巨頭和新興技術的競爭，但其在 CDN 和網絡安全領域的領導地位、龐大的基礎設施以及深厚的客戶關係，使其能夠抵禦大部分顛覆性威脅。其業務的基礎設施屬性賦予了其較強的持久性，屬於堅固的壁壘。","comment_en":"Akamai's business model possesses considerable durability for the foreseeable future. With the continuous growth of internet traffic, increasing demand for online security, and the rise of edge computing, Akamai's core services remain essential. Despite competition from cloud giants and emerging technologies, its leadership in CDN and network security, extensive infrastructure, and deep customer relationships enable it to withstand most disruptive threats. The infrastructural nature of its business grants it strong durability, representing a robust barrier."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Akamai 的護城河主要建立在其龐大的全球網絡基礎設施、顯著的規模經濟效應、深度整合的客戶服務所帶來的轉換成本，以及由此產生的客戶黏性之上。這使其在內容傳遞網路 (CDN) 和網絡安全領域具有堅固的競爭優勢，類似於一個高效運轉的「收費橋」，確保數據的快速、安全傳輸。儘管面臨雲端巨頭的競爭，其專注於網絡優化和安全的能力，以及品牌聲譽，使其能夠維持一定的定價權和客戶忠誠度。其護城河屬於堅固型，但非絕對壟斷。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Akamai's moat is primarily built upon its vast global network infrastructure, significant economies of scale, and the switching costs derived from deeply integrated customer services, leading to strong customer stickiness. This provides it with a robust competitive advantage in the Content Delivery Network (CDN) and cybersecurity sectors, akin to a highly efficient 'toll bridge' ensuring fast and secure data transmission. Despite facing competition from cloud giants, its specialization in network optimization and security, along with its brand reputation, allows it to maintain a degree of pricing power and customer loyalty. Its moat is considered robust, though not an absolute monopoly.","evidenceHash":"7906df5209e87fa65920bbf33d703f72909f0450f994f3379a1003391a8107f1","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"a604a3fec228bec1c5fb64e4f31b880f09f0d0b37f4652cba44d19e3ed720fcc"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"a604a3fec228bec1c5fb64e4f31b880f09f0d0b37f4652cba44d19e3ed720fcc"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/AKAM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/AKAM.png","website":"https://www.akamai.com","ceo":"F. Thomson Leighton","full_time_employees":"11000","description":"Akamai Technologies, Inc. (AKAM) is a leading global provider of cloud services, specializing in the secure delivery, optimization, and protection of online content and business applications across the internet. The company's primary focus involves offering sophisticated cloud-based solutions designed to shield digital infrastructure, websites, applications (including APIs), and end-users from a wide array of cyberattacks and online threats, all while simultaneously enhancing performance. Akamai further excels in accelerating web and mobile experiences, facilitating dynamic and highly responsive websites and applications. Its extensive media delivery offerings encompass seamless video streaming and player services, efficient game and software distribution, robust broadcast operations, authoritative Domain Name System (DNS) resolution, and comprehensive data analytics. Additionally, Akamai provides cutting-edge edge compute solutions, empowering developers to deploy and run their code directly at the network's edge for improved efficiency and reduced latency. The company also extends its expertise to telecommunications carriers, offering specialized services such as advanced cybersecurity protection, parental controls, resilient DNS infrastructure, and content delivery solutions. To ensure client success, Akamai offers a full suite of support services to assist with the seamless integration, configuration, optimization, and ongoing management of its diverse product portfolio. Akamai distributes its solutions through both its dedicated direct sales and service organizations and an extensive network of channel partners. Founded in 1998, Akamai Technologies, Inc. is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","description_en":"Akamai Technologies, Inc. (AKAM) is a leading global provider of cloud services, specializing in the secure delivery, optimization, and protection of online content and business applications across the internet. The company's primary focus involves offering sophisticated cloud-based solutions designed to shield digital infrastructure, websites, applications (including APIs), and end-users from a wide array of cyberattacks and online threats, all while simultaneously enhancing performance. Akamai further excels in accelerating web and mobile experiences, facilitating dynamic and highly responsive websites and applications. Its extensive media delivery offerings encompass seamless video streaming and player services, efficient game and software distribution, robust broadcast operations, authoritative Domain Name System (DNS) resolution, and comprehensive data analytics. Additionally, Akamai provides cutting-edge edge compute solutions, empowering developers to deploy and run their code directly at the network's edge for improved efficiency and reduced latency. The company also extends its expertise to telecommunications carriers, offering specialized services such as advanced cybersecurity protection, parental controls, resilient DNS infrastructure, and content delivery solutions. To ensure client success, Akamai offers a full suite of support services to assist with the seamless integration, configuration, optimization, and ongoing management of its diverse product portfolio. Akamai distributes its solutions through both its dedicated direct sales and service organizations and an extensive network of channel partners. Founded in 1998, Akamai Technologies, Inc. is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","description_zh":"Akamai Technologies, Inc.（美股代碼：AKAM）為 Technology 領域之重要企業，專注於 Software - Infrastructure 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"145 Broadway","city":"Cambridge","state":"MA","zip":"02142","country":"US","phone":"617 444 3000","full_address":"145 Broadway, Cambridge, MA 02142, US","range_52w":"70.82-165.45","year_high":165.45,"year_low":70.82,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":70.82,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-28","name":"Sundaram Mani","title":"officer: EV